# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IFA — environment template. Copy to `.env` and adjust.
#
# IFA is a fully static site: no database, no server, no runtime API.
# None of these variables are required to build or run it — the defaults
# (deterministic, offline, rule-only) are what CI and the deployed site use.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Base path for GitHub Pages project sites (e.g. "/info-for-all").
# Set automatically by .github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml. Leave unset locally.
# PAGES_BASE_PATH=

# Optional model-assisted providers. Each is DORMANT unless the variable names a
# registered provider AND its credential is present. The deployed build sets
# none of these and calls no external model.
# IFA_CLAIM_PROVIDER=
# IFA_EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=
# IFA_TRANSLATION_PROVIDER=
